              "sectionSpacing": 8,
              "source": "\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.55;padding:0 0 16px 0;\"\u003eRecord what the die made during your shift. You enter the number showing on the press counter \u0026ndash; the system works out what each cavity is owed. You never subtract anything.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003ePick the shift\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eChoose your \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eReporting shift\u003c/span\u003e.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eRead the press counter\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eType the number showing on the press counter right now into \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003ePress counter reading now\u003c/span\u003e. It is the counter\u0027s own reading, not a count of shots since your last entry.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12.5px;color:#9AA8BF;font-style:italic;padding:2px 0 14px 46px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eThe counter resets at the end of every shift, so it starts from zero each shift and only ever climbs.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e3\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eCompute it\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003ePress \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eCompute / Preview\u003c/span\u003e. Every cavity of the die gets a row.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12.5px;color:#9AA8BF;font-style:italic;padding:2px 0 14px 46px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eEach row says \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003ecredited thru\u003c/span\u003e \u0026ndash; the reading that cavity was last settled at, and the shots it is being credited now. A cavity whose basket was released earlier in the shift is credited only from that point on, which is why its number can differ from its neighbours.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e4\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eLog any scrap\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003ePress \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eAdd scrap reason\u003c/span\u003e on any cavity that had scrap. \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eGood (pc)\u003c/span\u003e updates on its own as you log it.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e5\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eSubmit\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003ePress \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eSUBMIT SHIFT OUTPUT\u003c/span\u003e when the rows look right.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"border-top:1px solid #172238;margin:2px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9AA8BF;padding-bottom:8px;\"\u003eWHAT ELSE IS ON THIS TAB\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eShot loss (all cavities)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; Shots the die made that produced no good part in ANY cavity \u0026ndash; a short shot, a purge. Logged once for the die, not per cavity.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eCavities with no basket\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; They still appear, with the part they are set up to cast, so their scrap can be recorded.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
              "style": {
                "fontSize": 13,
                "overflow": "auto"
              }
            },
            "type": "ia.display.markdown"
          }
